#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/pixel_brush_engine.rst:63
msgid ""
"The color will always become black in the end, and will work with Plain "
"Color, Gradient and Uniform random as source."
msgstr ""
"Farba bude nakoniec vždy čierna a bude fungovať s jednoduchou farbou, "
"prechodom a rovnomernou náhodnou farbou ako zdrojom."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/pixel_brush_engine.rst:68
msgid "Hue, Saturation, Value"
msgstr "Odtieň, nasýtenie, hodnota"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/pixel_brush_engine.rst:70
msgid ""
"These parameters allow you to do an HSV adjustment filter on the :ref:"
"`option_source` and control it with Sensors."
msgstr ""
"Tieto parametre umožňujú vykonať filter úpravy HSV na :ref:`option_source` a "
"ovládať ho pomocou senzorov."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/pixel_brush_engine.rst:73
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/Krita_2_9_brushengine_HSV_01.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita_2_9_brushengine_HSV_01.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/pixel_brush_engine.rst:74
msgid "Works with Plain Color, Gradient and Uniform random as source."
msgstr ""
"Funguje s jednoduchou farbou, prechodom a rovnomernou náhodnou farbou ako "
"zdrojom."

